["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">幅</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宽度；宽；余地；幅度；范围；差距；差异；幅度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220823\">この<ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>幅<rp>(</rp><rt>はば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が１マイルある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这条河有一英里宽。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/10654585\" title=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">省く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はぶく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">省略；节省</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>無駄<rp>(</rp><rt>むだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>手間<rp>(</rp><rt>てま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>省<rp>(</rp><rt>はぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">省去无谓的工夫。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">原</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原野；平原；草原；冻原；荒野；旷野</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">腹</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">腹部；肚子；胃；子宫；胎内；心意；真实意图；真实动机；勇气；胆量；意志力；慷慨；宽宏大量；感情；情感；宽阔的中间部分；凸起的部分；内部；内里；里面；波腹；鱼子计数；鼓腹容器（罐、瓶等）计数</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230723\">あの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>口<rp>(</rp><rt>くち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>腹<rp>(</rp><rt>はら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>反対<rp>(</rp><rt>はんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他的口和饥饿反对。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">針</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">针；别针；钩；螫针；尖刺；棘；针（如钟表等的指针）；订书钉；针线活；缝纫；恶意；敌意；针脚（计数单位）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144706\"><ruby>針<rp>(</rp><rt>はり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>親指<rp>(</rp><rt>おやゆび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>突<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いてしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我用针打了手指。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">張る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">粘贴；贴上；粘附；拉伸；展开；绷紧；张开；搭建；形成（如池塘结冰）；充盈；肿胀；伸出；突出；发布；张贴（链接等）；昂贵；价高；监视；留意；守望；拍打；扇打；听牌；（数学）张成；生成</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79840\"><ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどこにテントを<ruby>張<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るかだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">问题是要把帐篷放在哪里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">範囲</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はんい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">范围；范畴；领域；幅度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204735\">それらの<ruby>範囲<rp>(</rp><rt>はんい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>形<rp>(</rp><rt>かたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>不明確<rp>(</rp><rt>ふめいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它们的范围和形状不清楚。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">反抗</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はんこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">反抗；抵抗；抗拒；违抗；敌对；叛逆</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97496\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>王様<rp>(</rp><rt>おうさま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>法律<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>反抗<rp>(</rp><rt>はんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们反对国王制定的法律。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ハンサム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">英俊的；帅气的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231277\">あのハンサムな<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看看那个可爱的男孩。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">犯罪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はんざい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">犯罪；犯法；违法行为</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141259\"><ruby>戦争<rp>(</rp><rt>せんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人類<rp>(</rp><rt>じんるい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>犯罪<rp>(</rp><rt>はんざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">战争是对人类的罪行。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">判断</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はんだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">判断</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">判</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">犯人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はんにん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">犯人；罪犯；作案人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207165\">その<ruby>犯人<rp>(</rp><rt>はんにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだつかまっていない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那个犯人还没被抓到。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2256345\" title=\"Tatoeba · cienias\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · cienias\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">販売</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はんばい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">销售；出售；售卖；营销</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206792\">その<ruby>報告<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうこく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>販売<rp>(</rp><rt>はんばい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>関<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しては<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わしくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这份报告不适用于销售。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">場</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地点；场所；空间；领域；学科；范畴；范围；场合；情形；（戏剧、电影的）场；场景；（股市）交易时段；盘（前场、后场）；（纸牌游戏）牌桌；出牌区；（麻将）场；风圈（东场、南场等）；（物理学）场；（格式塔心理学）场；心理场</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223399\">このネクタイはこのような<ruby>場<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にふさわしくありません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这件衣服不适合这样的地方。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バイオリン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">小提琴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91768\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はバイオリンが<ruby>大変<rp>(</rp><rt>たいへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>上手<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她小提琴演奏得非常好。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/851475\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">馬鹿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">白痴；傻瓜；愚人；愚蠢的；傻的；呆板的；荒唐的；可笑的；微不足道的；琐碎的；令人失望的；失灵的；故障的；感觉迟钝的；极其；异常；非常；狂热爱好者；迷；痴迷于某事的人；中国蛤蜊（学名 Mactra chinensis）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"94885\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にまた<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うなんて<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>馬鹿<rp>(</rp><rt>ばか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她很愚蠢能再次见到她。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">莫大</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">广大；巨大；庞大；浩大；胖大海（Scaphium affine）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">爆発</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくはつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">爆炸；爆发；（情绪的）爆发；（愤怒的）爆发；（不满的）爆发</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212813\">そのニュースは<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>いか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>爆発<rp>(</rp><rt>ばくはつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">消息激发了他的愤怒。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バッグ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">袋子；包</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197972\">バッグはどこに<ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けばいいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我应该把行李箱放在哪里?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">罰する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばっする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">惩罚；处罚；处以罚款</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142717\"><ruby>生徒<rp>(</rp><rt>せいと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>罰<rp>(</rp><rt>ばっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することをなんとも<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我没有想过要惩罚学生。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ばったり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哗啦一声；砰的一声；扑通一声；意外地相遇；突然碰见；突然结束；戛然而止；骤然停止</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123619\"><ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でばったり<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いましてね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她在路上见到她。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vr