><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">管；管子；导管；烟斗；烟嘴；烟管；中间人；中介；调解人；人脉关系；沟通渠道</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111317\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はパイプをくわえて<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他用管道说话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パイロット</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">飞行员；驾驶员</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111316\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はパイロットになる<ruby>決意<rp>(</rp><rt>けつい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他决定成为飞行员。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">及格；通过（考试、检查等）；通行证；入场券；车票；（体育）传球；（轮到自己时）跳过；让过本轮；不出；（对某事）放过；婉拒；（围棋）虚手；停一手（已无有益着手时）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パスポート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">护照</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198077\">パスポートを<ruby>拝見<rp>(</rp><rt>はいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我可以看护照吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パーセント</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">百分比；百分数；百分率</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174932\"><ruby>現金払<rp>(</rp><rt>げんきんばら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いには１０パーセント<ruby>割引<rp>(</rp><rt>わりびき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如用现金付款，我们给予九折优惠。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/895842\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">灯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">灯；光</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140398\"><ruby>窓<rp>(</rp><rt>まど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>灯<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がともっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">窗口上有灯。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">比較</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひかく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">比较；对比</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147429\"><ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>写<rp>(</rp><rt>うつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したものを<ruby>原文<rp>(</rp><rt>げんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>比較<rp>(</rp><rt>ひかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">与原文所写的相比较。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">被害</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">损害；伤害；受害</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137777\"><ruby>台風<rp>(</rp><rt>たいふう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>多大<rp>(</rp><rt>ただい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>被害<rp>(</rp><rt>ひがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>与<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">风暴造成了多大损害。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">轢く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">用车辆碾过；轧死；撞倒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210972\">その<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にひかれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那只狗被车里抓住了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悲劇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひげき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">悲剧；悲剧戏剧；悲剧；灾难；不幸事件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214378\">すべての<ruby>悲劇<rp>(</rp><rt>ひげき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">死亡是一切悲剧的结点。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2394480\" title=\"Tatoeba · fenfang557\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fenfang557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">飛行</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">飞行；航空</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88740\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>初<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めての<ruby>飛行<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にたいへん<ruby>神経質<rp>(</rp><rt>しんけいしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她在第一次飞行时非常紧张。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">膝</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひざ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">膝盖；大腿上部（坐时）；膝盖及大腿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85500\"><ruby>膝<rp>(</rp><rt>ひざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にナプキンを<ruby>広<rp>(</rp><rt>ひろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把纳普金放在膝盖上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">非常</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">紧急；突发情况；极端；巨大；非凡；显著；异常；可怕；严重</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100689\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>非常<rp>(</rp><rt>ひじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ボタンをおした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他按下了紧急按钮。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/834488\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">必死</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひっし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">疯狂的；狂乱的；拼命的；必死；必然的死亡；（将棋）必至（无论如何应对都必被将死的局面）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"99650\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>名声<rp>(</rp><rt>めいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>守<rp>(</rp><rt>まも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろうと<ruby>必死<rp>(</rp><rt>ひっし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他一直在努力维护他的名声。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引っ張る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひっぱる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拉；拽；牵紧；架设；铺设；拉伸；拉向自己；扯（某人的衣袖等）；拖；拉；牵引；率领；带领；带往；押送（如嫌疑人去警察局）；邀请加入；强烈邀请参加；延迟；拖延；拉长（词语的）发音；引用；引述；参考；拉球（棒球术语）；穿；戴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220910\">この<ruby>生地<rp>(</rp><rt>きじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っ<ruby>張<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るとすぐ<ruby>伸<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种种植一旦拖动,就很快就会长大。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">必要</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひつよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">必要；需要</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这份工作需要英语。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">必</a></span></div></li>"]